 "text": "Hello there, how's life treating you? Lots of people struggle with that. One way to combat it is to draw a few eyes from someone who has them. Your drawing of your own eyes would look strange by comparison. Another way is to start each eye on the same horizontal line, then connect the tops but give each one its height. drawing the nose from the center line down and then connecting eyebrows at that point helps. You' see it in action. Enjoying the simple exercises is already improving. That's half the fun. Anytime. Drawing is like riding a bike, once you get the basics, it comes back quickly.",
